{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How We Became Heroes</strong> is a stylish and intense 2.5D shooter with roguelite elements, where you pilot a single ship through waves of grotesque enemies in chaotic, stunning environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world on the edge of collapse, a reluctant pilot is thrown into battle\u2014not for glory, but to survive. With every run, you unlock upgrades, sharpen your skills, and face increasingly unpredictable challenges. Featuring tight gameplay, a cinematic atmosphere, and colossal boss fights, each mission delivers tension, challenge, and a shot at redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by timeless shoot \u2018em ups with a modern, narrative-driven twist, this is a game that tests your reflexes, your strategy\u2014and your will to become a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover <strong>how we became heroes</strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669890?t=1774276475","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/8bac00e3f3e6db667b1599ef9247352ba62986bd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774276475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/59fa50df2eb326dcca090d23b47f33b69cc38383/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774276475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/59fa50df2eb326dcca090d23b47f33b69cc38383/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774276475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3971250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How We Became Heroes</strong> is a stylish and intense 2.5D shooter with roguelite elements, where you pilot a single ship through waves of grotesque enemies in chaotic, stunning environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world on the edge of collapse, a reluctant pilot is thrown into battle\u2014not for glory, but to survive. With every run, you unlock upgrades, sharpen your skills, and face increasingly unpredictable challenges. Featuring tight gameplay, a cinematic atmosphere, and colossal boss fights, each mission delivers tension, challenge, and a shot at redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by timeless shoot \u2018em ups with a modern, narrative-driven twist, this is a game that tests your reflexes, your strategy\u2014and your will to become a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover <strong>how we became heroes</strong>?</p>","developers":["FEEL THE PIXEL STUDIOS LTDA"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669890/46671ed1c2c9eb25f74dda2efaae505ca6280802/header.jpg?t=1774276475","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3669890/870110/42367e587d9808c333f5be99fea5346bedfe75e5/1750421147/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745866580","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3669890/870110/42367e587d9808c333f5be99fea5346bedfe75e5/1750421147/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745866580","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3669890/870110/42367e587d9808c333f5be99fea5346bedfe75e5/1750421147/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745866580","id":257126013,"name":"How We Became Heroes  - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_